{"seq":3,"slug":"terminal-appointment-api-resilience","title":"码头预约 API 对接与履约韧性：限流、超卖配额与失败重试工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/terminal-appointment-api-resilience","wordCount":3117,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"码头预约-api-对接与履约韧性-限流-超卖配额与失败重试工程\">码头预约 API 对接与履约韧性：限流、超卖配额与失败重试工程</h1><p>车队 TMS 的调度员在早班放号时手动点鼠标，和在系统里跑脚本抢号，面对的是同一件残酷事实：洛杉矶与长滩的集装箱码头<strong>各自运营自己的预约系统</strong>，没有一张跨码头的统一时段表（来源：pierpass.org/appointments/）。预约入口里既有 APM Terminals 的 TermPoint、WBCT 的 Voyager Track，也有被多个码头共用的 eModal 平台与各家自建门户（来源：pierpass.org）。这意味着&quot;预约对接&quot;在工程上从来不是一次 HTTP 调用，而是一层要同时应付<strong>限流、竞态、超时与不确定结果</strong>的韧性设计。上一节把预约抽象成&quot;窗口 + 容量 + 约束&quot;的三元组资源，本节只谈一件事：当这层资源必须通过一个你不控制的、可能限流、可能只回一个超时的外部接口来抢占时，怎么把&quot;抢得到&quot;变成&quot;抢得稳、抢错了能对账&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-预约-api-的三种对接形态与失效面\">核心概念：预约 API 的三种对接形态与失效面</h2><p>按可控程度从高到低，码头预约接口大致分三类。<strong>第一类是文档化的 REST/SOAP API</strong>，码头或平台方提供正式凭据、字段定义与配额说明，TMS 直连；这类接口的失效面主要是限流与鉴权，接口本身语义清晰。<strong>第二类是平台中转</strong>，eModal 这类第三方把多家码头的预约、闸口状态、箱况聚合到一个界面背后，车队接平台而非直连码头；优点是接入一次覆盖多码头，缺点是平台自身成为限流瓶颈与单点，一旦平台抖动，TMS 对所有码头同时失能。<strong>第三类是无 API 的门户</strong>，只有网页表单，只能用自动化脚本或人工操作，本质是对&quot;没有契约的接口&quot;做逆向。</p>\n<p>三类形态的差别不在调用语法，而在<strong>契约的明确程度</strong>，这直接决定了重试与对账的可设计性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对接形态</th>\n<th>契约来源</th>\n<th>主要失效面</th>\n<th>重试可设计性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文档化 API</td>\n<td>码头/平台官方</td>\n<td>限流、鉴权失效、字段版本漂移</td>\n<td>高（有明确响应码与幂等约定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台中转</td>\n<td>第三方平台</td>\n<td>平台抖动、多码头连带失能、二次限流</td>\n<td>中（平台语义可能吞掉底层错误）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无 API 门户</td>\n<td>逆向推断</td>\n<td>页面改版即失效、无幂等、易触发风控</td>\n<td>低（只能靠状态回读兜底）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上的正确姿势不是&quot;争取全部直连&quot;——多数码头短期给不出 API——而是把三种形态统一收在<strong>适配层</strong>之后：对上层 TMS 暴露同一组语义（查询可用时段 / 创建预约 / 取消预约 / 查证凭证），对下层各自实现。这正是同章 <a href=\"appointment-window-quota-model\">码头预约时段与配额模型</a> 里那张适配层图的下半部分；本节的剩余篇幅谈适配层内部真正难写的那几个部件。适配层之上还有一个跨层依赖：预约结果最终要与 <a href=\"../dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/geofence-eta-transit-visibility\">在途可视与异常处置</a> 里的闸口到达事件对齐，否则&quot;约了没来&quot;与&quot;来了没约&quot;永远分不清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限流-把发号接口当成稀缺通道来排队\">限流：把发号接口当成稀缺通道来排队</h2><p>码头放号接口被限流不是接口设计者吝啬，而是<strong>号码本身就是稀缺资源</strong>：如果允许无限并发请求，放号瞬间会被少数用脚本高频轮询的车队打满，中小车队拿不到号——限流在码头侧其实是配额公平性的执行手段。对 TMS 而言，这意味着必须<strong>主动做客户端限流</strong>，而不是等 429 之后再补救。</p>\n<p>标准做法是令牌桶（token bucket）。设桶容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、令牌补充速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（个/秒），过去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时刻余额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则当前可用令牌为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(t) = \\min\\left(B,\\ T_0 + r\\,(t - t_0)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(t) \\ge 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 才向码头发出创建请求，并扣减一枚令牌。桶容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的作用是<strong>允许突发</strong>（放号瞬间可以连发几个），速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 才是稳态限流的真正约束；把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 设得过大等于没限流，设得过小则放号当日抢不过别人。这两个参数的取值要靠<strong>观测码头实际容忍度</strong>反推，而不是拍脑袋。</p>\n<p>当服务端真的回 429（Too Many Requests），或回 503（Service Unavailable）时，响应应带 <code>Retry-After</code> 头，客户端必须遵守而不是立即重试。HTTP 语义的标准依据是 RFC 9110（HTTP Semantics）；429 这一状态码本身的定义在 RFC 6585 中给出，正是为&quot;限流&quot;场景引入的。工程红线是：<strong>忽略 <code>Retry-After</code>、用固定间隔硬重试，是把限流升级为封禁的最快方式</strong>——码头风控看到的是同源高频请求，很可能直接封 API Key，代价远大于退避几秒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超卖-占位与配额冻结-写接口里的竞态\">超卖、占位与配额冻结：写接口里的竞态</h2><p>发号接口真正难的部分是<strong>写</strong>：创建预约是一次分布式状态变更，而结果常常不确定。三种典型竞态需要分开处理。</p>\n<p>其一是<strong>超卖</strong>。一个时段容量 45，若 46 个请求同时到达且码头侧没有原子扣减，就会出现&quot;第 46 个也返回成功&quot;或&quot;成功但闸口不认&quot;。TMS 侧的防线是<strong>本地预占 + 服务端确认</strong>两段式：先在本地把名额标记为&quot;冻结中&quot;（hold），拿到码头确认后才转为&quot;已占&quot;；冻结项带 TTL（如 90 秒），超时未确认则自动释放。TTL 太短会导致&quot;放着放着名额被自己回收&quot;，太长则在码头拒绝时长时间占用本地配额。</p>\n<p>其二是<strong>占位与幽灵预约</strong>。同一主体用脚本大量创建、到时放弃，会让账面满载而实际空转。对抗它的不是限流（脚本可以在限流内慢慢约），而是<strong>按主体维度的在手预约数上限 + 取消冷却</strong>，并把履约率反馈回配额。这类反馈闭环的指标口径，见同章 <a href=\"appointment-window-quota-model\">码头预约时段与配额模型</a> 中&quot;履约率 / 无效率 / 重约率&quot;三件套。</p>\n<p>其三是<strong>幂等</strong>。创建预约是&quot;不幂等的写&quot;——同一个请求发两次，好一点的情况是第二个被拒（名额浪费），坏一点是<strong>生成两个凭证</strong>，司机到闸口时票对不上。因此凡是&quot;创建&quot;必须带客户端生成的幂等键：约定由调用方为每次业务意图生成一个唯一键，服务端对同一键只执行一次并回放首次结果。IETF 有专门的 <code>Idempotency-Key</code> 请求头草案（draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header）把这一约定标准化，即使码头接口不支持该头，TMS 也应在适配层内部维护&quot;幂等键 → 凭证号&quot;的映射：<strong>重试前先查映射，能查证就不重放</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败重试与幂等-区分-没做-与-不知道做没做\">失败重试与幂等：区分&quot;没做&quot;与&quot;不知道做没做&quot;</h2><p>重试策略必须先把失败拆成三类，因为它们的正确处理方式完全不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>明确失败</strong>（4xx 除 429）：请求格式、资格、库存问题，重试无用，应记业务异常并提示改约。</li>\n<li><strong>明确可重试</strong>（429、503、超时前的连接错误）：走退避重试。</li>\n<li><strong>不确定结果</strong>（请求已发出、响应超时或连接中断）：<strong>不能直接重放</strong>，必须先查证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>退避应采用指数退避加抖动（exponential backoff with jitter）。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试的延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n = \\mathrm{rand}\\!\\left(0,\\ \\min\\left(d_{\\max},\\ b \\cdot 2^{\\,n}\\right)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为基准延迟、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为延迟上限。<strong>抖动（jitter）不是可选项</strong>：若所有客户端都用同一个固定退避序列，一次限流之后它们会在同一时刻集中重试，形成二次尖峰，反而把服务端打得更久。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{rand}(0, \\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的&quot;完全抖动&quot;能把重试请求摊平，是实践中鲁棒性最好的形式。</p>\n<p>&quot;不确定结果&quot;的处理是这套设计里最容易被写错的一环，正确顺序应是：<strong>先读后写</strong>。带着幂等键去查询&quot;这笔预约是否存在&quot;，存在则直接采用，不存在才重发创建。当日放号时段内，一次超时若被误判为失败而重放，轻则浪费名额，重则生成重复凭证。这要求适配层必须支持&quot;按幂等键查证&quot;这一操作——即使底层码头 API 不提供，也要用凭证查询接口近似实现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[TMS 调度引擎] --&gt; B[统一预约适配层]&#10;  B --&gt; C{令牌桶: 按码头限流}&#10;  C --&gt;|令牌充足| D[带幂等键调用创建接口]&#10;  C --&gt;|无令牌| E[请求入等待队列]&#10;  D --&gt; F{响应结果}&#10;  F --&gt;|2xx 成功| G[落库预约凭证]&#10;  F --&gt;|429 或 503| H[读 Retry-After 退避]&#10;  F --&gt;|超时 结果未知| I[按幂等键查证]&#10;  H --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  I --&gt;|凭证不存在| D&#10;  I --&gt;|凭证已存在| G&#10;  G --&gt; J[对账: 与闸口事件比对]&#10;  J --&gt; K[履约率与无效率反馈配额]\">flowchart TD\n  A[TMS 调度引擎] --&gt; B[统一预约适配层]\n  B --&gt; C{令牌桶: 按码头限流}\n  C --&gt;|令牌充足| D[带幂等键调用创建接口]\n  C --&gt;|无令牌| E[请求入等待队列]\n  D --&gt; F{响应结果}\n  F --&gt;|2xx 成功| G[落库预约凭证]\n  F --&gt;|429 或 503| H[读 Retry-After 退避]\n  F --&gt;|超时 结果未知| I[按幂等键查证]\n  H --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; D\n  I --&gt;|凭证不存在| D\n  I --&gt;|凭证已存在| G\n  G --&gt; J[对账: 与闸口事件比对]\n  J --&gt; K[履约率与无效率反馈配额]</pre><h2 id=\"对账-把预约凭证与实际闸口事件对齐\">对账：把预约凭证与实际闸口事件对齐</h2><p>预约是&quot;计划&quot;，闸口进出是&quot;事实&quot;，二者对齐靠报文而非猜测。SMDG（UN/CEFACT 认可的航运业用户组）的集装箱报文体系里，<strong>CODECO</strong> 用于把卡车、火车、驳船的实际闸口进出报告给船公司（来源：smdg.org）；而预约本身并无同级专用报文——它只在码头私有实现中存在。这个不对称决定了对账的架构：<strong>预约凭证来自码头私有接口，闸口事实来自 CODECO 报文（或码头提供的门动作回执），TMS 必须在自己的库里把两者按箱号、车号、时间窗做匹对</strong>。</p>\n<p>对账产出的偏离分四类，处理方式各不相同：<strong>约了没来</strong>（预约存在、无对应闸口事件）计入无效率并反馈配额；<strong>来了没约</strong>（有闸口事件、无预约）说明存在无预约通道或违规通行，需单独统计；<strong>时段错位</strong>（计划 09:00、实际 13:00 到闸）是到达波动，走偏倚窗口而不判 no-show；<strong>凭证冲突</strong>（一票多凭证或凭证无效）是幂等失效的信号，需回查创建日志。没有这条对账链，配额调整就没有可信输入——一套不采集履约数据的配额表，要么永远过宽、要么持续误伤正常车队。</p>\n<p>对账还有一层合规价值。FMC（美国联邦海事委员会）依据《2022 年海洋航运改革法》（OSRA）持续收紧对滞期费与滞箱费的规制：2024 年 2 月 26 日《滞期费与滞箱费账单要求》最终规则在《联邦公报》公布（文件号 2024-02926，来源：fmc.gov）；2026 年 7 月 8 日哥伦比亚特区联邦上诉法院维持了 FMC&quot;滞期费必须促进货物流畅&quot;的决定（来源：fmc.gov）。滞期费的起算与免除很大程度上取决于**&quot;货主是否被给予了合理的提箱机会&quot;**，而&quot;某日某时段是否真的约得到号、约到了是否被闸口接受&quot;正是这一问题的直接证据。于是预约事件流从运营日志升级为合规证据——<strong>这也是为什么失败重试、幂等与对账必须留下可审计的记录，而不能只写进内存指标</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>码头预约 API 的韧性工程可以收束为四条判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>形态决定契约</strong>：文档化 API、平台中转、无 API 门户三类的失效面不同，统一收在适配层之后，才能对上层 TMS 保持同一组语义。</li>\n<li><strong>限流要主动做</strong>：令牌桶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(t) = \\min(B, T_0 + r(t-t_0))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 控制稳态速率、允许有限突发；收到 429/503 必须遵守 <code>Retry-After</code>（RFC 9110 / RFC 6585），硬重试是通往封禁的最快路径。</li>\n<li><strong>写操作必须幂等</strong>：创建预约带幂等键，重试前先查证，避免重复凭证与名额浪费；本地预占加 TTL 是防超卖的两段式。</li>\n<li><strong>不确定结果先读后写</strong>：超时不等于失败，指数退避加完全抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_n = \\mathrm{rand}(0, \\min(d_{\\max}, b \\cdot 2^n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 摊平重试尖峰。</li>\n<li><strong>对账让计划与事实闭合</strong>：预约凭证与 CODECO 闸口事件匹对，产出履约率、无效率与错位率，既喂养配额反馈，也构成 FMC 滞期费争议中的&quot;合理提箱机会&quot;证据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话收束：真正区分一个车队 TMS 好坏的，不是它能不能调通某个码头的预约接口，而是当这个接口限流、超时、回一个模糊结果时，它是否仍然知道<strong>自己到底约上了没有</strong>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"码头预约 API 对接与履约韧性：限流、超卖配额与失败重试工程","id":"码头预约-api-对接与履约韧性-限流-超卖配额与失败重试工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：预约 API 的三种对接形态与失效面","id":"核心概念-预约-api-的三种对接形态与失效面"},{"level":2,"text":"限流：把发号接口当成稀缺通道来排队","id":"限流-把发号接口当成稀缺通道来排队"},{"level":2,"text":"超卖、占位与配额冻结：写接口里的竞态","id":"超卖-占位与配额冻结-写接口里的竞态"},{"level":2,"text":"失败重试与幂等：区分\"没做\"与\"不知道做没做\"","id":"失败重试与幂等-区分-没做-与-不知道做没做"},{"level":2,"text":"对账：把预约凭证与实际闸口事件对齐","id":"对账-把预约凭证与实际闸口事件对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"双重运输与街转（street turn）匹配引擎：机会约束下的成本最优配对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/dual-transaction-street-turn-engine"},"next":{"title":"派单分配与司机作业流：任务派发、接单确认与到场签到闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/dispatch-assignment-driver-workflow"}}